{"id":"663250","name":"剁椒肉沫米粉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663250/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"江西米粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"米粉冷水下锅。","img":"images/663250/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"煮至米粉断生捞出过冷水备用。","img":"images/663250/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉沫提前绞碎备用。","img":"images/663250/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油，打入鸡蛋两面煎至金黄盛出。","img":"images/663250/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中底油放入肉沫炒散。","img":"images/663250/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"适量蚝油将肉沫炒入味。","img":"images/663250/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入剁椒。","img":"images/663250/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒出香味。","img":"images/663250/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量清水，大火煮开。","img":"images/663250/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入煎好的鸡蛋一起煮入味，少许盐鸡精调味。","img":"images/663250/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入米粉。","img":"images/663250/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火煮开后加入葱花即可。","img":"images/663250/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663250/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663250/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}